  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_typ\": \"CEFR Englis_English Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nAlthough the internet has revolutionized communication and access to information, it also presents significant challenges. The rapid spread of misinformation online is a growing concern for individuals and society as a whole. Social media platforms have become prime hubs for the dissemination of falsehoods, which can lead to harmful outcomes such as political misinformation or health scares. However, with efforts towards improving digital literacy and fact-checking mechanisms, there is hope for a more informed internet future.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What challenge does the text primarily discuss?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The positive impact of social media on communication.\",\n        \"The dangers of misinformation spreading online.\",\n        \"The benefits of fast internet connections for learning.\",\n        \"The importance of accessing information from multiple sources.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following is NOT mentioned as a consequence of misinformation on social media?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Political divisions.\",\n        \"Health panics.\",\n        \"Economic stagnation.\",\n        \"Polarization of opinions.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"The term 'digital literacy' refers to:\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The ability to navigate online platforms.\",\n        \"The skill of recognizing and correcting misinformation.\",\n        \"The knowledge of how to use social media for marketing purposes.\",\n        \"The ability to create viral content on the internet.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What suggestion is made regarding the future of the internet?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Internet usage should be strictly regulated.\",\n        \"Efforts to improve digital literacy and fact-checking are necessary.\",\n        \"The internet will continue to spread misinformation uncontrollably.\",\n        \"Social media platforms should be banned altogether.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"The author's tone can best be described as:\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Optimistic about the future of digital media.\",\n        \"Not clear, leaves reader uncertain.\",\n        \"Despairing over the current state of misinformation on social media.\",\n        \"Cautiously hopeful about progress in fact-checking.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"A\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
